* medicationPrescriptionList.medicationPrescription.dosage.dosageSteps.regularDosage.DosageByRamp_attr.dosageEndLevel 1..1 contentReference #registermedicationprescription.medicationPrescriptionList.medicationPrescription.dosage.dosageSteps.regularDosage "DosageType_virtual" "den dosering som gäller vid Doseringsstegets slut Rekursiv: samma struktur som registermedicationprescription.medicationPrescriptionList.medicationPrescription.dosage.dosageSteps.regularDosage."
